#!/usr/bin/env python
"""
Standalone snippet-based marginal log-likelihood-ratio (marginal_loglr)
followup and coincidence tool.

Takes primary candidate triggers from pycbc_inspiral_fir (or merged trigger
HDF5 files), reconstructs the complex SNR time series around the primary trigger
peak as well as across the zero-lag sky window and background time-slide windows
in the secondary detector(s) using matchedfilter.TimeDomainFilterBank, evaluates
the marginal logLR directly via PyCBC's SingleTemplate / DistMarg inference
marginalization infrastructure, and writes a standard PyCBC coincidence HDF5
output file supporting all active detector combinations.
"""

